03:04:31.309 --> 03:04:32.089
<v tim-pritlove>Ruf mich an.

03:04:33.009 --> 03:04:33.809
<v luka-dornhecker>Ne, ne, ruf mich.

03:04:33.989 --> 03:04:41.669
